{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1378766-a-reminder-on-artifact-classification","id":1378766,"title":"A reminder on Artifact classification","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-05T08:22:15-07:00","id":1378766,"title":"A reminder on Artifact classification","content":"An artifact made in the First Age does not need to be made with First Age Artifice.<br /> <br /> An artifact made with First Age Artifice could have been made before the First Age, or in the Second Age.<br /> <br /> An artifact made with First Age Artifice can be any rating, not just N/A. It is technically possible for a 2-dot artifact made with First Age Artifice to exist.<br /> <br /> An artifact made with First Age Artifice <i>may </i>have a &quot;magitech&quot; aesthetic, but it is <i>absolutely</i> not necessary.*<br /> <br /> An artifact made without First Age Artifice <i>may </i>have a &quot;magitech&quot; aesthetic, just as it may have a &quot;Helltech&quot; aesthetic, or a &quot;Necrotech&quot; aesthetic, or a &quot;Biopunk&quot; aesthetic.<br /> <br /> <br /> * All warstriders thus far have hewed to the magitech aesthetic because they're being designed by fans of Mecha anime, <i>for </i>fans of Mecha anime. But it's entirely possible to design and fluff a warstrider to have a different aesthetic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":636,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","user":"Sunder the Gold","date":". 04-05-2020, 11:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:",